Title: "Overview"
Id: "23624cc8-e4b1-4905-ae97-68a368b694b7"

Text: "Structural groups may contain a `Metadata:` section with nested metadata items.

```mlg-fragment
Metadata:
. id: \"stable-id\"
. version: \"1\"
```

Direct top-level `Id:` sections are also supported. `mlg check` generates missing direct `Id:` sections for top-level items and reports duplicates."
Id: "11dc8592-ade6-45fc-ad2e-8bf84c7bd49a"
